The instant application has been filed with the following prayer:-
"WHEREFORE, it is most respectfully prayed that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased:
(i) To quash the entire proceedings and consequential proceedings of Criminal Case No. 48721 of 2024 (State of U.P. v. Mandeep Singh Hora and Ors.). arising out of Case Crime No. 98/2023 under sections 323, 504, 506, 498A IPC and 3/4 Dowry Prohibition Act, 1961, Police Station Manak Nagar, District Lucknow, pending in the Court of Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate VII, Lucknow;

(ii) To quash the impugned summoning order, dated 01.02.2024, passed in Criminal Case No. 48721 of 2024 (State of U.P v. Mandeep Singh Hora and Ors.) whereby the Applicants have been summoned as accused to stand trial under Sections 323, 504,
506, 498A IPC and 3/4 Dowry Prohibition Act, 1961;
(iii) To quash the impugned charge-sheet, dated 20.10.2023, arising out of Case Crime No. 98/2023 under sections 323, 504, 506, 498A IPC and 3/4 Dowry Prohibition Act, 1961, Police Station Manak Nagar, District Lucknow;
(iv) To stay the proceedings of Criminal Case No. 48721 of 2024 (State of U.P v.
Mandeep Singh Hora and Ors.), arising out of Case Crime No. 98/2023 under sections 323, 504, 506, 498A IPC and 3/4 Dowry Prohibition Act, 1961, Police Station Manak Nagar, District Lucknow, pending in the Court of Additional Chief Judicial Magistrate VII, Lucknow;
(v) To stay the operation as well as the implementation of the impugned summoning order, dated 01.02.2024, passed in Criminal Case No. 48721 of 2024 (State of U.P v.
